{"game": "risk-of-rain-returns", "language": "english", "appid": 1337520, "month": "2024-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1734307200, "end_date": 1734998399, "month_true_total": 90, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 00:53:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "183505130", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072238466", "personaname": "eric8418182", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/eric8412/", "num_games_owned": 195, "num_reviews": 121, "playtime_forever": 569, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 569, "deck_playtime_at_review": 484, "last_played": 1734916689, "avatar": "17076a9e3c07353e414f45288fd937a69cdc2434"}, "language": "english", "review": "5/10 Average\n\nI really enjoyed this game on steam deck. It plays almost exactly like risk of rain 2 if that game was a side scroller. I played risk of rain 2 first and enjoyed that, this game has that same appeal. It is somewhat difficult and each play through is a little different. Easy to pick up and start enjoying right away instead of having to really get into the game. I think this game plays great on the deck and is more enjoyable than risk of rain 2 on the deck. With that said, risk of rain two is a better game. It just has more to it, but there is something about the game being more simplistic that makes it fun to play and enjoy while listening to a podcast or doing something else.", "timestamp_created": 1734982144, "timestamp_updated": 1734982355, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.489167630672454834", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183498873", "author": {"steamid": "76561199689980978", "personaname": "hamodiuus", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199689980978/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1377, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 226, "last_played": 1780395959, "avatar": "7a8f70f57b00785db057208bff67d9b27f769472"}, "language": "english", "review": "better than both ror2 and 1\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1734977006, "timestamp_updated": 1734977006, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183439412", "author": {"steamid": "76561198435773068", "personaname": "Strangebird", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198435773068/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 2077, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2077, "last_played": 1763837761, "avatar": "88cd9df026639d92d88a67795d5f2b6d0b71e473"}, "language": "english", "review": "this is for the 2 people who are conflicted between ror returns and ror2 get ror2, even with the new problems with gearbox its better than this game. with that said I do think this game is very polished, its fun, progression is fun, characters are fun, if thats all you want to hear in this review then whatever get the game. I have my problems that I should mention about this game, the main one is how random it is, I play a lot of roguelikes, but this is by far the most random one i have played, it is almost impossible to get a good run consistently and if your in a bad spot their is no way your going to save that run, the lack of printers and scrappers in this game hurts it. It feel like everything is out of luck and its all fate that decides weather you win or lose a run. On to the good, most of the items are very fun to use barring a few exceptions, which is good in a game where your picking a lot of items. The characters are all mostly interesting, the new characters are neat and most enemies are fair to fight (except some flying enemies)", "timestamp_created": 1734918361, "timestamp_updated": 1734918361, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183420552", "author": {"steamid": "76561198888750292", "personaname": "ClashThePerson", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ClashThePerson/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 934, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 576, "last_played": 1739046452, "avatar": "38e0dd2004972b2d4771f32037699cf341c2748d"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1734900927, "timestamp_updated": 1734900927, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183417061", "author": {"steamid": "76561199387174678", "personaname": "hckevinlouie", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199387174678/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2096, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1781, "last_played": 1757126622, "avatar": "af1cf9cf15be50bc6eda5a5c35bb1698bbf77ecd"}, "language": "english", "review": "die", "timestamp_created": 1734898460, "timestamp_updated": 1734898460, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.473251044750213623", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true